---
// 3 nút nổi cho máy tính (ẩn trên điện thoại): Hotline – Zalo (bản nước ngoài: Chỉ đường) – Về đầu trang
import { getLang, getInfo, ui } from '../i18n';
const lang = getLang(Astro.url);
const t = ui(lang);
const info = getInfo(lang);
const btn = 'group relative flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-espresso/20 transition hover:scale-105';
const tip = 'pointer-events-none absolute right-full mr-3 rounded-full bg-espresso px-3 py-1.5 text-sm whitespace-nowrap text-cream opacity-0 transition group-hover:opacity-100';
---
<div class="fixed right-5 bottom-6 z-50 hidden flex-col gap-3 lg:flex" aria-label={t.quickContact}>
  <a href={`tel:${info.phoneRaw}`} class={`${btn} bg-cocoa text-cream`} data-track="click_call" aria-label={`${t.callHotline} ${info.phone}`}>
    <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 5 5L15 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 3 6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2"/></svg>
    <span class={tip}>{lang === 'vi' ? 'Hotline' : t.call} {info.phone}</span>
  </a>
  {lang === 'vi' ? (
    <a href={info.zalo} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class={`${btn} bg-[#0068ff] text-xs font-semibold text-white`} data-track="click_zalo" aria-label={t.chatZalo}>
      Zalo
      <span class={tip}>{t.chatZalo}</span>
    </a>
  ) : (
    <a href={info.mapLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class={`${btn} bg-ivory text-cocoa border border-line`} aria-label={t.directions}>
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5a7 7 0 0 1 14 0C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
      <span class={tip}>{t.directions}</span>
    </a>
  )}
  <button id="to-top" type="button" class={`${btn} invisible translate-y-2 border border-line bg-ivory text-cocoa opacity-0`} aria-label={t.toTop}>
    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"/></svg>
    <span class={tip}>{t.toTop}</span>
  </button>
</div>

<script>
  const top = document.getElementById('to-top');
  const toggle = () => {
    const show = window.scrollY > 600;
    top?.classList.toggle('invisible', !show);
    top?.classList.toggle('opacity-0', !show);
    top?.classList.toggle('translate-y-2', !show);
  };
  window.addEventListener('scroll', toggle, { passive: true });
  toggle();
  top?.addEventListener('click', () => window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' }));
</script>
